        <mxCell id="77" parent="62" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="Benefits:&lt;div&gt;- Better modularity/flexibility in including features&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Nicer on my head when thinking about how to incorporate new features&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- &#39;Feels better&#39; than one large ~700 line .comp file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Can get more precise measurements on timings for passes (more video content)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="281" width="219" x="43" y="155" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="78" parent="62" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="Not Benefits:&lt;div&gt;- Thinning the swap, this will be big&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Debugging could become harder - more to look through&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Potential performance hits?&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
