        <mxCell id="80" parent="62" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="How will I pass data between shaders?&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Could bind textures, able to send a vec4 per pixel per texture to each new pass&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;What kind of data needed to pass?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Raycast results (Position, Normal, TriInx, MatIdx)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Triangle information&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Material information&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Pass &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;information&lt;/font&gt; or &lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 51, 51));&quot;&gt;idx&lt;/font&gt;?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Have to pass materials into intersection ; &#39;feels wrong&#39;, intersection is for intersection, not calculating uv coordinates&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Other passes have a nicer time ; will be handling raw data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Limits passing structs around (And copying definitions...)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(102, 255, 102));&quot;&gt;- Probably faster working in images&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Final image (Post-processing)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="224" width="680" x="580" y="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
